{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB《東張西望》今集報導鼻咽癌患者張先生因懼怕常規治療副作用，誤信中介遠赴日本接受索價高昂自體免疫細胞治療法 …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB《東張西望》今集報導鼻咽癌患者張先生因懼怕常規治療副作用，誤信中介遠赴日本接受索價高昂自體免疫細胞治療法。他在短短時間內狂燒250萬港元積蓄注射15針，換來的卻是腫瘤急速惡化壓迫視覺神經。這場標榜無痛根治絕症跨國醫療騙局最終迎來令人毛骨悚然驚人反轉。</p>\n<h2>張先生誤信中介赴日治癌致惡化</h2>\n<p>2022年8月確診初期鼻咽癌後，張先生為逃避電療與化療副作用，透過香港醫療中介前往日本診所求醫。中介負責人聲稱只需注射3至5針免疫細胞便可迅速見效，整套療程花費不超過100萬港元。然而張先生打到第5針時視力開始出現重影，緊急返港進行磁力共振掃描後，香港腫瘤科醫生震驚發現其癌症已急速惡化至第四期A。巨大的腫瘤不僅侵蝕骨骼，更嚴重壓迫視覺神經，隨時面臨永久失明危機。</p>\n<h2>中介無視《東張》質詢推卸責任</h2>\n<p>面對香港醫生處方口服化療藥緊急壓制病情，中介負責人竟公然挑戰專業判斷，力勸張先生停藥並推銷能量枕頭及蘇打水等偽科學產品。當《東張西望》攝製隊就事件向該中介公司展開正面交鋒時，中介代表前言不對後語，辯稱張先生嚴重出血「只係身體排出已死癌細胞嘅正常現象」。中介更倒打一耙，嘲諷香港腫瘤科專家「可能未接觸過免疫細胞治療法，所以誤判咗病情」，其後更企圖以私隱條例阻撓節目播出。</p>\n<h2>腫瘤科專家李宇聰醫生痛斥謬論</h2>\n<p>針對中介種種荒謬說法，本港臨床腫瘤科專家李宇聰醫生接受訪問時給予嚴厲駁斥。李宇聰醫生明確指出國際正規醫學界在臨床上根本沒有任何確實證據證明免疫細胞療法對鼻咽癌有實質療效。對於中介宣稱出血是排出死癌細胞，李宇聰醫生直接痛批其解釋「完全荒謬、醫學上徹底錯誤」，強調癌組織潰爛出血是腫瘤侵蝕大血管極度危險信號。張先生最終轉赴廣州接受傳統常規癌症綜合治療，在正規放化療精準打擊下病情才迅速得到控制。</p>\n<h2>網民怒轟無良中介謀財害命促嚴懲</h2>\n<p>事件經節目曝光後迅速引爆網絡怒火，大批觀眾對中介公司唯利是圖手法感到極度心寒。不少網民在討論區留言怒轟「呢啲中介根本係謀財害命」、「呃病人救命錢真係會有報應」，認為當局必須嚴正介入調查。同時有網民指出面對絕症時切勿病急亂投醫，直言「有病一定要睇正規專科醫生」、「信偏方同埋無科學根據療法只會延誤救治黃金期」。張先生勇敢公開慘痛經歷，成功為大眾敲響醫療騙局警鐘。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371760098396550_6211699966ae9f561a0ebd.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 張先生不幸確診患上鼻咽癌。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371760098396550_6211699966ae9f561a0ebd.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張先生不幸確診患上鼻咽癌。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371760833851052_2464982306ae9f56892ca6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 張先生滿懷希望展開療程。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371760833851052_2464982306ae9f56892ca6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張先生滿懷希望展開療程。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371761336742673_8977064596ae9f56d9244c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 張先生的身體狀況呈懸崖式崩潰。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371761336742673_8977064596ae9f56d9244c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張先生的身體狀況呈懸崖式崩潰。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371762350174106_15834104666ae9f577b3506.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 每針索價16萬港元。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371762350174106_15834104666ae9f577b3506.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>每針索價16萬港元。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371762985556980_16147674236ae9f57e1a59e.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 天花亂墜的「嶄新醫學神話」往往成為患者最致命的催命符。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371762985556980_16147674236ae9f57e1a59e.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>天花亂墜的「嶄新醫學神話」往往成為患者最致命的催命符。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371763629382849_16855538486ae9f58482d5c.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 鼻咽癌若能「早發現、早治療」，初期患者的5年相對存活率高達九成以上。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371763629382849_16855538486ae9f58482d5c.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>鼻咽癌若能「早發現、早治療」，初期患者的5年相對存活率高達九成以上。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1793717640936915_7899682946ae9f58921246.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 中介聲稱該項革命性技術尚未正式引入香港。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1793717640936915_7899682946ae9f58921246.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>中介聲稱該項革命性技術尚未正式引入香港。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371765015485145_13724201776ae9f59255148.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 日本醫生曾隨口提議張先生接受常規電療。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371765015485145_13724201776ae9f59255148.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>日本醫生曾隨口提議張先生接受常規電療。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371765593289533_7195229726ae9f5982f059.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 日本醫生表示需要持續加針。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371765593289533_7195229726ae9f5982f059.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>日本醫生表示需要持續加針。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371766112836490_479066596ae9f59d6b566.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 中介叫停化療藥力推「能量枕頭」。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371766112836490_479066596ae9f59d6b566.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>中介叫停化療藥力推「能量枕頭」。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371766511836479_15903306896ae9f5a15b693.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 張先生轉投廣州正規治療即好轉。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371766511836479_15903306896ae9f5a15b693.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>張先生轉投廣州正規治療即好轉。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371767077950884_17309843106ae9f5a7502a0.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 梁敏巧隨後就事件向該中介公司展開正面交鋒。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371767077950884_17309843106ae9f5a7502a0.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>梁敏巧隨後就事件向該中介公司展開正面交鋒。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371767694660799_4690582966ae9f5ad2a646.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 本港著名臨床腫瘤科專家李宇聰醫生在接受《東張西望》訪問時給予嚴厲駁斥。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371767694660799_4690582966ae9f5ad2a646.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>本港著名臨床腫瘤科專家李宇聰醫生在接受《東張西望》訪問時給予嚴厲駁斥。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371768283145156_10306727546ae9f5b345aac.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 本港著名臨床腫瘤科專家李宇聰醫生在接受《東張》訪問時給予嚴厲駁斥。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371768283145156_10306727546ae9f5b345aac.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>本港著名臨床腫瘤科專家李宇聰醫生在接受《東張》訪問時給予嚴厲駁斥。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371768889541926_7326198176ae9f5b922173.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"tvb 東張西望 事主授權東張曝光防他人受害。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179371768889541926_7326198176ae9f5b922173.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>事主授權東張曝光防他人受害。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/tvb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">TVB</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">東張西望</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%86%ab%e7%99%82%e9%a8%99%e5%b1%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">醫療騙局</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bc%bb%e5%92%bd%e7%99%8c/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鼻咽癌</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535444\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 3 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:41:04.414422+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1778,"images":15,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T14:54:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:41.366533+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T16:38:41.366533+00:00","content_hash":"e733172d584489f7a57d92ed74dc8cb0341e27afa098829d321c465c23f09750","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}